!! CMAQ statements that were NOT translated (core groups only):
!! NOT TRANSLATED R041 (merged): merged into the flag-8 O1D quenching reaction emitted for the first O1D quencher
!!     [<R041> O1D + N2 = O3P # 2.15E-11 @ -110.;]
!! NOT TRANSLATED R364 (skipped): not translated (CH4 tracer duplicate of the CH4 + OH reaction)
!!     [<R364> ECH4 + HO = MO2 # 2.45E-12 @ 1775.;]
!! NOT TRANSLATED TRP58 (dropped): reactant is a particle-phase organic species (ATRPNJ); ASP has no particle-phase organic chemistry
!!     [<TRP58> ATRPNJ = AHOMJ + HNO3 - 1.0000*DELTA_N # 9.26E-05;]
!! NOT TRANSLATED TRP59 (dropped): reactant is a particle-phase organic species (AHONITJ); ASP has no particle-phase organic chemistry
!!     [<TRP59> AHONITJ = AHOMJ + HNO3 - 1.0000*DELTA_N # 9.26E-05;]
!! CMAQ_HET_BEGIN
!! CMAQ gas->particle uptake (tier 1), see cmaq_het.py / NewMechanisms_README.md
!! flag 3: gamma, MW; flag 18: scale, MW, kind, channel (acid-dependent epoxide uptake)
!! GLY -> AGLY: constant gamma 0.0029 (CMAQ GAMMA_GLY)
!! MGLY -> AGLY: constant gamma 0.000261 (CMAQ GAMMA_GLY x 0.09)
!! IEPOX -> AISO3NOS: acidity-dependent (flag 18, kind 1, channel 1, scale 1)
!! IEPOX -> AISO3OS: acidity-dependent (flag 18, kind 1, channel 2, scale 1)
!! IPX -> AISO4: acidity-dependent (flag 18, kind 1, channel 0, scale 2)
!! INALD -> AISO5 + HNO3: acidity-dependent (flag 18, kind 1, channel 0, scale 0.5)
!! N2O5 -> 2 HNO3: flag 20
!! NO3 -> HNO3: flag 3
!! HO2 -> OffGas: flag 3
!! NO2 -> 0.5 HONO + 0.5 HNO3: flag 21
GLY => AGLY ; 3 ; 0.0029 ; 58 ; 0 ;
MGLY => AGLY ; 3 ; 0.000261 ; 72 ; 0 ;
IEPOX => AISO3NOS ; 18 ; 1 ; 118.1 ; 1 ; 1 ;
IEPOX => AISO3OS ; 18 ; 1 ; 118.1 ; 1 ; 2 ;
IPX => AISO4 ; 18 ; 2 ; 150.1 ; 1 ; 0 ;
INALD => AISO5 + HNO3 ; 18 ; 0.5 ; 195.1 ; 1 ; 0 ;
N2O5 => 2 HNO3 ; 20 ; 1 ; 108.01 ;
NO3 => HNO3 ; 3 ; 1e-3 ; 62.0 ; 0 ;
HO2 => OffGas ; 3 ; 0.2 ; 33.0 ; 0 ;
NO2 => 0.5 HONO + 0.5 HNO3 ; 21 ; 1e-4 ;
!! CMAQ_HET_END
